oṃ hāṃ brāṃ netrebhyo namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ brāṃ brahmāśvai namaḥ । paritaḥ (l.5) kalaśeṣu oṃ hām indrāya namaḥ । oṃ hām agnaye namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ yamāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ niṛri(ṛ)te namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ varuṇāya namaḥ । oṃ (l.6) hāṃ vāyu(ya)ve namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ kuberāya namaḥ । oṃ hām īśānāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ viṣṇave namaḥ । ityabhyarcya । dhūpa-(p.45a, l.1)dīpādikaṃ datvā – atra dhvajapaṭādikaṃ datvā – tatpaṭaṃ purirtarpaṭe? nikṣipyā(pya) – āpaḥpunantu iti mantreṇa kūrcenābhimantryā(ntrya) – āpaḥpunantu (l.2) pṛthivīṃ pṛthivī pūtāpunātu māṃ punantu brahmaṇaspati brahma pūtā punātu mām – yaduściṣṭāma bhojyaṃ yadvā duścaritaṃ (l.3) mama sarvaṃ punantu māmāposvatāṃ ca – pratigrahaṃ svāhā – iti svarṇabimbavṛṣabhaṃ jale nikṣipyā(pya) – tadanantaraṃ kṣīra(l.4)pūritabhāṇḍe kṣīramadhye – svarṇabimbaṃ nikṣipyā(pya) – bhāṇḍopari paṭaṃ nikṣipya āptāya svati(svasti)mantri(ntraṃ) japitvā - (l.5) āapya(pyā)ya svasame kṛte viśvataḥ somavṛṣṇiyaṃ bhavāvājasya saṅgathe(te?) adbhyaḥ sambhūta iti – uttara(re) nārāyaṇaṃ japet - (l.6) tadanantaraṃ dhyā(dhā)nye nikṣipyā(pya) – apavitraḥ pavitreti japitvā – apavitraḥ pavitro vā sarvāvasthāṃ gato'pi vā (l.7) yaḥ smaret pārvatīśānaṃ sabhāhyābhyantaraśśuciḥ – tadanantaraṃ kṛṣṇādisukhaśayyāditi adhivāsanaṃ kṛtvā – āśuśāneti (p.45b, f40a, l.1) mantraṃ japitvā – paṭaṃ pūrvavat tripādūrdhve nikṣipyā(pya) – guruḥ triśūlagraṃ? gatvā – śūlāvāhanam – śivabrahmaviṣṇupārvatī vāṇī (l.2) rāmā ityādigadyaṃ paṭhitvā – muktādipratyekam āvāhanādi । dhūpadīpādikaṃ datvā । bherīsamīpaṃ gatvā dhūpadīpādikaṃ (l.3) datvā - samīpadhaṃ(traṃ) sacūtapatraṃ vā gri(gṛ)hītvā – śrīmadyatreti mantreṇa bheriṣu tāḍanaṃ kṛtvā caṇḍeśvaravutsaveśvaraṃ gri(gṛ)hītvā (l.4) stambhāntikaṃ gatvā – stambhaṃ toyairabhiṣicyā(cya) – kalaśodakairabhiṣicyā(cya) – gandhapuṣpairalaṅkṛtvā ॥ brahmā(l.5)viṣṇugādigadyaṃ paṭhitvā – vande vṛṣabhadehāya svastyaṣṭāśītigadya(dyaṃ) paṭhitvā – dhvajārohaṇaṃ kṛtvā – naivedyadhupadīpādikaṃ (l.6) kṛtvā – maṅgala(lā)rātrikaṃ kṛtvā – balipīṭhāntikaṃ gatvā – tatra brahmāṇamāvāhayet – brāhmakumbhodakaiḥ prokṣyā(kṣya) brahmaṇe (p.46a, l.1) baliṃ datvā – dhyānaṃ ca brahmatālādikaṃ kṛtvā – pūrve indradiśimāgamya – indrakumbhodakaiḥ prokṣyā(kṣya) – indrabaliṃ datvā (l.2) indrapadyaṃ paṭhitvā – guru – agnidiśaṃ gatvā – agnikumbhodakaiḥ prokṣyā(kṣya) – pūjābalidhūpadīpādikaṃ datvā - tattāla(l.3)padyaṃ paṭhitvā – yāmyādīśapūrveśyā – prokṣaṇārcanādikaṃ kṛtvā – nartakena tālaṃ taṭiṃ kṛtyā(tvā) - (l.4) naiṛtyāntikaṃ gatvā – tatkumbhatoyena pūjā baliṃ datvā – dhūpadīpādikaṃ datvā – śāśvadviśveti dhyānam - (l.5) ajñātā ceti tālaṃ mallatālamiti nartakenavaditi pā(vā)dyaghe(gho)ṣeṇe varuṇāgrakaṃ gatvā – mantrodakena prokṣyā(kṣya) - (l.6) pūjāvidhāna(naṃ) kṛtvā – baddhaprakriyakiṃ kṛtvā gadyaṃ paṭhitvā – baliṃ datvā – vāyukoṇe praveśya – pādyāni vārina (p.46b, f41a, l.1) pīṭhopari – vāyumūrtimāvāhya – ghaṭatoyai saṃprokṣya baliṃ datvā – vande gandhavahaḥ astu paravastubhaṇitaṃ vādyaghoṣeṇa (l.2) kumbherāntikaṃ da(ga)tvā – kuberakumbhatoyai arcana arcanabaliārātrakamupacāraṃ kṛtvā – cetoyādikapranagajaṃ campaka(l.3)cadati mukvānte vādyena yī(ī)śānāntikaṃ gatvā – guru – īśānamūlena śā(īśā)nakumbhodakai prokṣyā(kṣya) – yī(ī)śāna(l.4)miti dhyānam – kanakaniryati tālaṃ – pūjāṃ vidhāya – ityaṣṭavidhā lokapāla(lā)vāhanam – prākārāntare vā – (l.5) rathapade vā kṛtvā – va(u)tsaveśvaraṃ kalyāṇamaṇṭape saṃsthāpyā(pya) – pūjā naivedyaṃ dhūpadīpādikaṃ datvā – iti vṛṣayāgavidhipaṭalaḥ ॥ śubhamastu । gurubhyo namaḥ । (p.47a blank, 47b, f42a, l.1)
