 śrī grāmāntarabhāvita-sakalabrahmacārivargāṃ ca prātasnānasandhyāvartanajapa(l.6)tarpaṇabrahmayajñasamindhomabhayikṣācaraṇa – vedādhyāyana – guruśi(śu)śru(śrū)ṣaṇaniratā bhavantu । te sarve uṣṇāmbu(p.52b, l.1)snānadantadhāvanā añjanānulepanagandha-puṣpadhūpo vā – naścāndrāvāsata? – svapnaretaskhalana strīsahaśayanastapa(spa)riśa(rśa)na – (l.2) maithunakāmakrodhalobha-mohamadamātsariyu(rya)ahiṃsādibrahmacariya(rya) – vaikaliya(lya)vimukhāsu bhavantu । asmin (l.3) śrigra(śīghra)megrahastayā vargāśca yajanayājanaadhyaina(dhyayana)adhyāpakadānadānapratigrahaṣaṭkarmaniratarā bhavantu । (l.4) te sarve sthālīpāka-māgrahāyaṇamaṣṭakāpiṇḍapitṛyajño māsīśrāddhacaitrāśvatthavājayiti sapta(l.5)pākayajñayājino bhavantu । te sarve agnyādheya-magnibhotṛṃ(ktṛṃ) darśapūrṇamāsavāgrahāyaṇe diścā? kūrmāsyāni (p.53a, l.1) rūḍapaśubandhasautrāmaṇīti sapta(ptā)havī yajñayājino bhavantu । te sarve agniṣṭomotyagniṣṭomauddhā(l.2)ṣoḍaśīti vājapeyātirātroptoryāma(ryamā) iti saptasomayajña-yājino bhavantu । asmin grāme sthitānāṃ sarveṣāṃ (l.3) mahājanānāṃ snānajapānuṣṭhānāṃ garbhādhānapuṃsavanasīmantonnayana-viṣṇubalijātakarma(l.4)nāmakaraṇānnaprāśanakarṇavedhacaulopanayanasamidādhānavedā......caturvidasamāvartana(l.5)vivāhaupāsanapiṇḍapitṛyajñabhūtayajñamanuṣyayajñabrahmacaryāgnihotṛdarśapūrṇamāsakṛcchracāndrāyaṇa(p.53b, f48a, l.1)cāturmāsyānirūḍha-paśubandhasautrāmaṇiparvaṇāṣṭakamanuśrārddha(ddha)pitṛśrārddha(ddha)sarpabala(li)īśānabalyāyuṣyahoma(l.2)apamṛtyuhomanakṣatrahoma-graha mama vājapeyarājasū(sūya)somayāgāśvamedhetyādicatu(tuḥ)ṣaṣṭhikalāḥ – pravi(vī)ṇāḥ (l.3) santu । etat grāme vaidika-mahāśaiva-śivabrāhmaṇasthāpanaprokṣaṇakarma prāyaścittanitya(l.4)naimityakāmyādiāgamabhedādibhedaprabalayajanayājana-adhye(dhyaya)nādhyāpakadādana(dāna)dānapratigrahaṣaṭkarmacāraye (l.5) viśeṣanirvāṇācaryaātmārthaparārthapūjāprakāra-aupāsanayantra(ntrā)dikarma devālayastutipradakṣiṇastotra(l.6)namaskāradevadarśanavidyāpīṭhaguropacārakapilārcanasiddhānta-śravaṇamadhāhikavaiśvadevabalīndaraṇa(p.54a, l.1)dīkṣādānabhojanaatithisatkāradharmaśravaṇadharmasukīrtanapurāṇaśravaṇa-grahopakaraṇa ityācāradeśikaḥ – (l.2) uttarottarābhivri(vṛ)ddhi(ddhiḥ) bhūyāditi bhavanto'nugṛhṇantu ॥ eta śrī grāmāntarhā – vitatapasvinaḥ pañcendriyāṇi nigrahaśivadhyāna(l.3)parāyaṇaśivārcanāni kurvantu ॥ kulanānye vṛtadhanaruṇyo bhavantu ॥
gāvo'pi vatsavita(l.4)śeṣaṃ – kṣīrāmṛtogdhantu ॥ ayaṃ deśādhipo rājā – akhilabhuvana...pālamaulimālālaṅkri(ṅkṛta) (l.5)pādapadmakalpatarutālamegharaktākārasurabhicintāmaṇiprabhṛti vanānyo bhavantu ॥ sa rājā – sarva(p.54b, f49, l.1) bhauma yeva bhūyāt sacaturānanaaparimitaa(ā)yurārogyaaiśvaryā bhavantu । sa rājā–samastadigantasthāpitajayastambha(l.2)-nirata(nta)ro bhavantu ॥ sa cakravartiśeṣadharaṇīrasātalasutalanitalabhūrbhavaḥ suvarmahajanastapasatyasurakula(l.3)pātādiharau dādisamastabhuvanavyāptayaśastomo bhavantu ॥
sa rājā - aṅgavaṅgakaliṅgakoṅkaṇagāndhāra(l.4)kāśmīrakāmbhojadrāviḍaoḍyājinajonamagadhamālavakulavatuluṣkara-saurāṣṭramahārāṣṭrapāñcāla(l.5)avantikābhīrakuṭajakarṇāṭakakūrjarasiṃhala-keralakekayaceracolapāṇḍyapāñcāla-(l.6) pramuporthikhamakuṭamaṇigaṇanikaranirājitavīrasiṃhāsanasthitarājabhāva-ramaṇi(ṇī)yyo bhavantu ॥ (p.55a, l.1)
sa ra(rā)jā – kauśāpakauśatejorāśiprakāśo bhavatu ॥ sa rājā – nalanṛga?nahuṣanābhāti – purūpurukurja-savya(l.2)samarūkta – indradyumna – dharmajaya – dharmacāritracaritraye ॥ tasya sarve manuṣyāḥ – lakṣmīkṣmābījā sāvitri(trī) (l.3) gāyatri(trī) sarasvati(tī)samānalakṣaṇalakṣitabhūyāsu bhavantu ॥ tasya kumāro viṣṇumukhasaśalilāparākrama-(l.4) kārtikeya – suravarasumukhāsu bhavantu ॥ tasya kumāravargāśca vedavedāṅgastrī । itihāsapurāṇa(l.5)ṣaṭsamayajñāna-yogaśāstra-tarkaśāstra-śabdaśāstra । (-)dhanurvedāyudhāśramastraprayoga-sagrāma-(l.6)kāvyanāṭakālaṅkārakavitva-vīṇāveṇu-mṛdaṅgādi-vādya-akṣaralekhyā-patraśchada-indrajāla-(p.55b, f50a, l.1)mahāndrajāla-naṣṭamuṣṭi cintanālābhālābha-svecaścā(cche)ṣṭagraha-kāśāgatodaṅparakāyapre(pra)veśa-sāmudriki-nānābhāṣa(l.2)parikṣa-aśvarikṣa-japarikṣa-ratnaparīkṣa-kanakaparīkṣa-nārīparīkṣa-dāruparīkṣa-bhūparīkṣa-mantravāda(l.3)rasavāda-gāndhavāda-viṣaharaṇa । (-)pratyauṣadha-vaśyākarṣaṇa-stambhana-mohana-uccṭana-māraṇa-(l.4)vidvye(dve)ṣaṇa-vyādhijananāgni-sābha jalastābha-senāstambha-vākstambha-vāyustambha-gaṇitavāktāsāmarthya-(l.5)śaurya-cakrajñānākhya-catuṣṣaṣṭhikalā-nipuṇā bhavantu ॥ tasyāmātyapramukhāśeṣa-sevakavargāśvatthā(l.6)nukūlatāmacaratu ॥ tasya śatruvargāśca te nṛpahrītadhanadhānyadūrīkṛtaputramitrakalatragotra-ścidravastra-dhāraye (p.56a, l.1) bhavantu ॥ asau rājā – vedaśāstrādisakalavidyāvānnirantarā lakṣmīvān prītimān nītimān bhūtimān vikhyātavān - (l.2) dyutimān – dhṛtimān – buddhimān – vaddhimān । (-) śauryavān-vīryavān-audāryavān-gāmbhīryavān-dhairyavān-(l.3)āyuṣmānārogyavān-javān-pratibhānuvān-yuktimān-śaktimān-bhaktimān-bhuktimān-(l.4)raktimān-suktimān-dayāvān-dākṣiṇyavān-rakṣāvān-śikṣāvāṇ(n) bhūyāditi mahānto'nugṛhṇantu ॥ (l.5) asmadrājñā-viracitagobhūdānakannikādānahiraṇyadānatulādānapuruṣaviśca(śva)-cakrakālacakra-tilaṃ (l.6) kṛtilaparvata-daśadhanuśrīdevatāmūrtiubhayato'khilaśrīmūrtianekamahādānāni sāṅgopāṅgāni sarvābhīṣṭa(p.56b, f51a, l.1)siddhipradaṃ bhūyāditi mahānto'nugṛhṇantu ॥ atha(yaṃ) śrī grāmaḥ – aśanavasanādivividhakalyāṇaparam – pārāyaṇavihita-(l.2)vaiśravaṇa-nivāso vyādhivimukto bhavantu ॥ atha śrī grāmaḥ – tiraskṛtataskarapuṇyapuṣkalo bhavantu ॥ ayaṃ śrī grāmaḥ - canda(l.3)campākavañjulahintālatālatamālākṛtamālāsaralavakulaśakubhakuṭajalikucanālikerāmrapūgapunnāga-(l.4)kadalīkapitthāśvatthakuravakumaruvakakundatindukacandanasahacakāyakavā cāmpeyacanasanavetasapāṭala(l.5)paṭala-priyālupriyāyai anekanivahai parivratodyānamaṇḍito bhavantu ॥ asmin grāme niditaṭākādyakhilāmbu(l.6)cakravāka-kauñceyahaṃsamidhunamaṇḍanamaṇḍitapulunaṣaṇḍo bhavatu ॥ etadaṅkurārpaṇa-prabhṛti - (p.57a, upadeśānugraham, l.1) āvā-hanāntānuṣṭhitakra(kri)yākalāpāḥ sarve avikalāt hṛdayaśāntino'bhavat ॥ eta(tat) dhvajārohaṇādyavarohaṇāntam – (l.2) śrī śaktiyātrānuṣṭhitakra(kri)yākalāpāḥ sarve avikalāt hṛdayaśāntino bhavatu ॥ etanmahotsavapravartaka-(l.3)paridṛḍa(ḍha)puruṣāḥ sarve śrī kālakaṇṭhakalasthaśrīmadānandavallijanāya kikaṭākṣavīkṣaṇaparipūrṇapuruṣāyuṣo (l.4) bhavantu ॥ śrī śaivaṃ vardhatām – śrī kāmākṣīdevyai namaḥ । asmadgurubhyo namaḥ । etat (l.5) śivālaye arcanācārya – alaṅkaraṇācārya – sthānācārya – pacanācārya – dravyācārya - tatkulavedaśivāgamaśāstramantro(l.6)padeśakarmaṇi sumuhūrto'stūtyanuguhṇantu ॥ upadeśasya janānāṃ pātakādimanovākkāyakṛta(p.57b, f52a, l.1)pātakādīni ādiśabdena mahāpātako upapātaka(kā)nupapātakādi(dī)ni samastadoṣān nāśano bhavantu ॥ upadeśasya (l.2) śiṣyāṇāṃ samastapāśavimocanakaro bhavatu । śiṣyāṇām āyuparyantaṃ – bhuvane vividhaaiśvaryasiddhipradaṃ (l.3) bhavatu । śiṣyāṇām āyurārogyamaiśvaryaputraprado bhavatu । aṇimādipramukhāṣṭamahāratnapuri(rī) (l.4) pūrṇāni bhavatu ॥ upadeśasya mantrasiddhipradaṃ bhavatu ॥ mantropadeśasya jñānaṃ jñānākhyā dīptavat prakāśo (l.5) bhavatu ॥ jñeyaṃ bhāskaravat prokṣa(kta)miti jñānaṃ viśiṣyate bhavatu ॥ śiṣyāṇām avabodhaśivajñānātparaṃ (l.6) prāsādamantramayamantraṃ paramādhikaṃ bhavatu ॥ tatprāsādamantraṃ svāśrā(śra)yāṇāṃ janānāmadhikāro'ṣṭasiddhi(p.58a, l.1)pradaṃ bhavatu ॥ etat prāsādaṃ bhajatāṃ japatāṃ samastasiddhiprado bhavatu ॥ mantraṃ śivamantravit puruṣa eva su(sū)kṣmavit (l.2) jñātvā tu sarvapāpāt pramucyate bhavantu ॥ etat śivamayaṃ bījaṃ śivasvarūpasadṛśaṃ - prāsādākṣaraṃ (l.3) paparamāyikaṃ bhavatu ॥ yathā ravikaraṇenaiva svayaṃ prakāśo'yaṃ jñānasiddhicintārahitaḥ śivararṇa eva (l.4) paramiti kathyate bhavatu ॥ upadeśamantreṇa sālokasāmīpasārūpasāyi(yu)jya-padaṃ bhavatu ॥ (l.5) śiṣyāṇāṃ jīvānte parabhogastu vidyeśvarādipadaprāptiḥ padaṃ navatāṃ paramokṣastu sālokādi-(l.6) paramātmanivṛtyā(ttyā)dibhuvanāprāptirbhavatu । na tadanupada....yabhuvanapādanamāyā mahāmāyāditaśivaḥ samāna(l.7)-sarvajñatādiguṇaprāptatvame(meva) paramamuktipadaṃ bhavatu ॥ e....vālaye arcanācāryaalaṅkaraṇācāryasthānāca(cā)rya-(p.58b, f53a, l.1)pacanācācarya-dravyācārya-satkulavedaśivāgamaśāstrapurāṇajñā catuścatvāriṃśatkarmaniratarāścatuṣṣaṣṭhikalā-(l.2)pravīṇāḥ śāpānugrahasāmarthyahārakeyūrakanakakuṇḍalavajra(jrā)bharaṇavibhi(bhū)ṣtāḥ santu । purāṇajñā tu (l.3) catvāriṃśat karma niratāścatuṣṣaṣṭhikalāvīṇāḥ śāpānugrahasāmarthyahārakeyūrakanakakuṇḍalavajrā(l.4)bharaṇavibhūṣitaḥ santu । āsanā vāhanārghyeṇa gandhasthāpanaṃ svāgataṃ tathā sannidhyāṃ sannirodha......ṅga(l.5)pratyaṅgakalpanaṃ pādyamācamanāryaṃ gandhapuṣpaiste(sto)yaiva ca – dhūpadīpastatā(thā) snānaṃ vastraṃ caivopavītakaṃ (l.6) gandhaṃ puṣpaṃ tathā dhūpaṃ dīpaṃ nīrāñjanaṃ tathā – darpaṇavyajanādyaṃ ca mudrādarśanameva ca āvṛtā ca na naivedyaṃ (p.59a, l.1) homādibalidānakam – samādhistu japaṃ stotraṃ pradakṣiṇanamaskṛ(skri)yā – culukodakapradānaṃ ca pustakārādhanaṃ tathā - (l.2) arghyamācamanaṃ caivi(va) visarjanīyamidaṃ mṛtā catvāriṃśopacāristu ātmārthe devapūjane – śrī śivāya (l.3) namaḥ । gurubhyo namaḥ । ekāmbranāthare(ரே) தோ(து)ணை. śubhamastu । (remaining portion blank, p.59b, f54a, utsavaba(pa)ddhati, l.1)
(utsavapaddhati -)
athotsavapaddhatiṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ । tatrādau siddhāntaratnāvalyā(lyām) । kāmikayogamaṃ(jaṃ) cintyakāraṇājitadīptasūkṣma-suprabhedacandrajñāna(l.2)vīratantrasārāsahasrarauravavātulādi – upāgamānālocya lakṣadvayodhyāpakaparameśvaraparamanāmadheya-(l.3) śrīmadaghoraśivācāryaviri(ra)citāyāṃ nityanaimittikakāmyaprāyaścittakriyājālaṃ karṣaṇādipratiṣṭā(ṣṭhā)ntaṃ (l.4) pratiṣṭhādyutsavāntam utsavādiprāyaścittāntaṃ pratipādakabandhatiśca avalokya taduktaṃ maryādayā saṅgrahaṇarūpe(l.5)ṇotsava-paddhati sarveṣāmupakārayet । kariṣye – prathamā vṛṣabhayāgaṃ tu dhvajārohaṇa(ṇaṃ) tatparam । bherītāḍanasmṛtayaḥ (l.6) caturtham aṅkurārpaṇaṃ pañcamaṃ yāgaśālāyāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ tu ma(a)taḥparam ṣaṣṭa(ṣṭha)maṃ astrayāgaṃ tu । saptamaṃ balidānakaṃ yāgakramaṃ tu (p.60a, l.1) navami – pariveṣe daśe tathā – paścāt nirajmana(nīrājanaṃ) proktaṃ – rudrasaṅkhyamiti smṛtā tataḥ pratisaraṃ datvā dvādaśaṃ tu vidhīyate – tīrthasaṅgrahaṇaṃ kṛtvā – (l.2) trayodaśamiti sta(ta)thā । cūrṇotsavamataḥkṛtvā – caturdaśakṛto bhavet – avarohaṇavidhiṃ paścāt pañcādaśakriyo bhavet – śo(ṣo)ḍaśaṃ (l.3) snapanākhyātaṃ guru kṛtvā yat yathākramam ityādi-bhedenotsavaṃ bhūtvā siddhāntaratnāvalyuktaprakāreṇa śaivādi । daivikā(l.4)ntabhedena uttamottamaṃ navāhotsavaṃ ca vidhiḥ vidhīyate – tadyathā tatpūrve rātrau adhivāsanahomakarmabalidānaṃ ca (l.5) ārabhet – tatra ācāryādāya ārohaṇā-dyavarohaṇaparyantāni – nemana – ekabhuktā – adhaśśayanaparā tailābhyañjanādirāhityena (l.6) ādau saṅkalpya – iṣṭadevatāṃ namaskṛtyā(tya) kṛtadvitīyatri(tṛ)tīyacaturthapañcaṣaṣṭhanānvāhe । dvivaraṅliḥ? daśāhe prātaḥ(p.60b, l.1)kāle ba...rkāryaḥ taddine cūrṇotsavaṃ tīrthakarma ca ārabhet । atra navāhotsave dhvajārohaṇapūrvameva kāryaṃ (l.2) mārgaśīrṣe ādrā(rdrā)ntaṃ puṣyamāse puṣyāntaṃ māghe māghāntaṃ phāṇguṇe uttaraphalguṇyāntaṃ caitre caitrāntaṃ vaiśākhe viśākhāntaṃ (l.3) jyeṣṭhe jyeṣṭhāntam a(ā)ṣāḍe uttarāṣāḍāntaṃ śrāvaṇe śravaṇāntaṃ bhādre bhādrāntam āśvije aśvinyāntaṃ kārtike (l.4) kṛttikāntam eva(vaṃ) māsanakṣatrāṇi tīrthakāryaṃ pūrvayukte samudrasnānaṃ praśastā nadyādau viyukte vā kāryaṃ māghamāse (l.5) ṣaṣṭhyanta(ntaṃ) aṣṭamyāntaṃ jyeṣṭhamāse kṛṣṇaprabhṛdhi(ti) proktau pūrvāhne vā aparāhne vā tithiyuktaṃ cema(nma)dhyā(dhya)dināt parā nadyādau (l.6) tīrthaṃ grāhya ru(ṛ)kṣadvaye ca saṃprāpte yogayuktaṃ cet pūrvam evam ārohaṇāditīrthāntaṃ viṣu (l.7) ayanāntaṃ grahaṇānta(taṃ) veti rtha(tīrtha)mārabhet śaivādiśivotsavādīnāṃ prātaḥkāle avabhṛtaṃ sāyaṃ kāle ārabhet – niśi sāyāṃ(yaṃ) (p.61a, mṛtsaṅgrahaṇam, l.1) divā prātaḥ dhūpamārabdhaścenna doṣaḥ śivayāge । anyayāge kṛte sati na phalau(lam) । ekavāstuni devotva(tsava)sya madhye nṛttakalyāṇa(ṇaṃ)(l.2) na kārayet – kṛtaṃ cet doṣo bhavati – utsavārambhakāle rathādi(dī)n kṛtvā vighneśaṃ saṃpūjya – bhakṣyabhojyādi(dī)n naivedya – (l.3) astrarājaṃ caṇḍeśvaramapi saṃpūjya – śilāsaṅgrahaṇavat
(dārusaṅgrahaṇam -)
dārusaṅgrahaṇaṃ kuryāt – pāyasaṃ nivedya kevalaṃ (l.4) caṇḍeśvaraṃ vālaṅkṛtya grāma-pradakṣiṇaṃ kuryāt । tataḥ vighneśaṃ saṃpūjya – śilālaṅgrahaṇavat dārusaṅgrahaṇaṃ kuryāt । (l.5) dhvajadaṇḍaṃ bilvavṛkṣabhrati(kṣaṃ prati) pūrvoktavṛkṣeṣu agraṃ saṃpūjya bi(ba)lividhāyā(ya) nirodhyā(dhya) paraśuṃ cindyāt pūrve vā uttave(re) (l.6) aiśānyāṃ vā patitaṃ cet kalyāṇam anyathā santyajet – tat śrī(svī)kṛtya ādāyā(ya) śili(lpi)nā saha rathe kṛtvā kautukam agre badhvā (l.7) gandhena snāpya punaḥ puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā āsthānamaṇṭape gatvā tailādinā vimṛjya sarveṣāṃ tāmbūlaṃ dāpayet – tataḥ (p.61b, l.1) sthaṇḍilaṃ vidhāya । tanmadhye daṇḍaṃ ca vinyasya – vastrādyairalaṅkṛtya – gandhamālyādibhirabhyarcya dhūpadīpaiḥ(pau) saṃpūjya – śivabhāgāditaḥ saṃpūjyā(jya) । (l.2) praṇavenābhyarcyā(rcya) nivedhya(dya) sāmānyapratiṣṭo(ṣṭho)ktavat pratiṣṭhāpayet iti dārusaṅgrahaṇavidhiḥ ॥
(aṅkurārpaṇavidhiḥ -)
dhvajāṅkurārpaṇaṃ pūrvaṃ dvitīyaṃ (l.3)mṛ(u)tsavāṅkuraṃ tri(tṛ)tri(tī)yaṃ ca mitiproktaṃ tīrthāṅkuramitismṛtam । navasaptatriyāheṣu sadye vājavāpanaṃ mṛtsaṅgrahaṇam (l.4) ācāryaḥ kundalyādikārakā gri(gṛ)hītvā caṇḍeśvaramalaṅkṛtya – astrarājasaṃhitaṃ nānādhvajasahitaṃ prāsunā nālikera(l.5)sahitaṃ tadante pālikādisahitaṃ nānāchatrasahitam । bimbiṃ ca pāṅmukho vā udaṅmukho vā gatvā nadītaṭākapuṣpavane vā gatvā bhūmiṃ (l.6) śivatoyenā(na) prokṣya – puṇyāhaṃ vācaitvā hṛdayenābhyarcya kundalyāṃ ca hṛdaye saṃpūjya – bhūmimāvāhyā(hya) gandhādyairabhyarcya hṛda... (p.62a, l.1)na paritaḥ lokapālān saṃpūjya – astreṇa khanitvā akṣatai lājakuśo paristīrya । prāṅmukho vā udaṅmukhaḥ tatpuruṣeṇa pāṇibhyāṃ (l.2) mṛttikā sthālyāṃ kuśopari īśānamantreṇāhṛtya – nikṣipya – punaḥ prokṣya – hṛdayena puṣpaṃ vinyasya gi(gī)tavādyasahitam evaṃ mṛtsaṅgrahaṇaṃ (l.3) kṛtvā gajādyai(dyaiḥ) vāhayitvā – paścāt ālayaṃ praviśya nivedyā(dya) upacāraiḥ pūjayet – pālikāghaṭikā-śarāvāṇām । (l.4) sauvarṇāṃ tu mṛṇmayaṃ tu vā grāhyā(hya) devāgrapārśve dvaye gomayalepitakṣetro । pañcagavyenā(na) prokṣya – puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā (l.5) prāgdeśe daśasūtram । udakpradeśe daśasūtraṃ vidhāyā(ya) madhye pañcaviṃśatipade śālibhiḥ droṇasamittai(த்தை) tadartha(l.6)staṇḍulai(laiḥ) śobhitaṃ kṛtvā – kuśai paristīryā(rya) sthaṇḍilai aṣṭapatraṃ vilikhya pūrṇakumbhaṃ sakūrcaṃ sāpidha(dhā)naṃ savastrahiraṇyasahitaṃ vardhanī(l.7)dvayaṃ ca saṃsthāpya – gandhādibhiralaṅkṛtyā(tya) – madhyakumbhadhyānam ।
śvetavarṇaṃ dvinayanaṃ śvetapadmoparisthitam ।
dvibhujaṃ kumudopetaṃ śveta-vastreṇa veṣṭitam ॥ (p.62b, vṛṣapratiṣṭai(ஷ்டை-ṣṭhā) l.1)
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ muktābharaṇabhūṣitam ।
kirīṭamakuṭopetaṃ prabhāmaṇḍalamaṇḍitam ॥
kṛttikā dakṣiṇe bhāge *rohiṇī vāmapārśvake । *(l.2)
dukūlavadanāṃ raktāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām ॥
	evaṃ dhyātvā vidhānena saṃpūjya pūrvavadācaret - (l.3) pāyasānnaṃ nivedya tāmbūlaṃ datvā – upacāraiḥ prapūjayet – paścāt dve dve pade dvāracaturdikṣu caturdikṣu(rep.) । (l.4) padeṣu ghaṭikā aṣṭau sthāpanīyya – niruṛtyādikoṇeṣu । catuṣpade catuṣpade śarāvāṇi aṣṭau sthāpanīyyā - (l.5) eteṣāṃ pālikādīnām । kuśaiḥ pālālai(śai?)rva(rvā) suṣiraṃ bandhayet – mṛdbhistu pālikādi(dī)n pūrayet pālikādyādhidevatāśca (l.6) īśvaraviṣṇuviriñco devatāḥ ghaṭikānadhidevatāḥ ādityasamayyai vivasvata । jalādhipa mitrā soma pṛthivī । dhara । īśānādihutāśanā (l.7) pūṣṇavitrādau ........ditaye īśānā āpā āpavatsa – savitā sāvitrā । indrā indrajayā । rudra rudradāsaka । iti vidikṣu pūjayet - (p.63a, l.1) sva sva nāmabhiḥ āsanādimūlamantrairabhyarcya – bījāni vāpayet tadyathā yavā ni(nī)vārāmudgatilamāṣaśimbakuluttha-niṣpāvakasarṣapāṇi (l.2) payasā prakṣālya hṛdā saṃsthāpya śivabi(bī)jamantraiḥ bījāni vāpayet – paścāt dalāgre lokapālānabhyarcya – dalamadhye - (l.3) aṣṭavasūnabhyarcya – svastimaṅgalavācakai(kaiḥ) kumbhajalena prokṣya gandhatoyena nityaṃ pūjayet – eteṣāṃ pāyā(ya)sa(sā)nnaṃ (l.4) nivedya – dhūpadīpau datvā japāntaṃ ne(ni)vedya – sarveṣāṃ tāmbūlaṃ datvā ācāryādibhiḥ dakṣiṇān dadyāt iti (l.5) aṅkurārpaṇavidhiḥ ॥
(vṛṣabhapratiṣṭhādhivāsanavidhiḥ -)
dhvajārohaṇapūrve tadrātrau adhivāsanakriyāṃ kārayet – tataḥ śivaṃ saṃpūjya – vijñāpya vitānadarbhamālādyai(dyaiḥ) (l.6) vṛṣabhasthānamalaṅkṛtadeśikaḥ uttarābhimukho bhūtvā sthirāsana-pūrvoktavadaṅganyāsādikaṃ kṛtvā vṛṣabheśvaraṃ gandhapuṣpādinā (p.63b, l.1) saṃpūjya mudgānnaṃ nivedya – vijñāpya – tasyāgre sthaṇḍilaṃ vidhāya pañcatalapramāṇena aṣṭadroṇaśālyādibhiḥ sthaṇḍilaṃ vidhāyā(ya) madhyamātmā vilikhya (l.2) kuśaiḥ puṣpaiḥ paristhī(stī)rya vṛṣabhabījena saṃpūjya – tatra navakalaśān vāripūritān sakūrcān sāpidhān kumbhān saṃsthāpya (l.3) madhye vṛṣabhaṣaḍutthāsanaṃ saṃpūjya – āsanamūrtimūlamantryai(ntrai)- rabhyarcya – pūrve – ukṣāya namaḥ । agne – gopataye namaḥ । dakṣiṇe - (l.4) oṃ śri(śṛ)ṅgiṇe namaḥ । naiṛte – nandine namaḥ । paścime – vṛṣapataye namaḥ । vāyudeśe – vṛṣāṇi namaḥ । uttare – śaṅkukaṇṭhāya namaḥ । aiśānyām – mahodarāya (l.5) namaḥ । ityādha(dhā)nādimūlamantryai(ntrai)rabhyarcya – sva sva nāmnā saṃpūjya athavā lokapālān saṃpūjyā(jya) – yathāsthāna-māvāhanādi kṛtvā sarvopacārai(raiḥ) (p.64a, l.1) saṃpūjya – dhvajapaṭam uttamā navapaṭaṃ pañcabhāgaikavistāraṃ vistārasamaṃ pucchaṃ pucchārdhaśikharaṃ sitaṃ saślakṣaṇaṃ kārpāsādisaṃbhavaṃ (l.2) paṭān tribhāgaṃ kṛtvā madhye bhāge vṛṣamālikhyā(khya) śvetavarṇe raktavarṇena śri(śṛ)ṅgakaṇṭhya...rāṇi – pītena puccham । akṣiṇi śveta(l.3)kṛṣṇau ca kṛtvā paścāt pūrṇakumbhaṃ ca dīpadvayaṃ ca ghaṇṭāṃ ca darṇaṃ ca śrīvatsasvastikaṃ ca śeṣamaṅgalarūpiṇī । vilikhya । evaṃ (l.4) dhvajapaṭaṃ vinyasya । dhvaja-yāgamārabhet । tataḥ puṇyāha(haṃ) vācayitvā – arghyapādyādikaṃ kṛtvā – pañcagavyādibhi(bhiḥ) prokṣya vṛṣabhacalāsanaṃ (l.5) datvā saṃpūjya – tasyāgre sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā agnikāryoktamārgeṇa homaṃ ca kṛtvā beraśuddhyanantaraṃ anyadeśe manorame (l.6) sthi(stha)ṇḍiladvayaṃ saṃpādyā(dya) tatra madhye – vṛṣabhapaṭaṃ nyastvā asya jalena saṃprokṣya hemasūcikāya sūryasomamantreṇākṣi-mocanaṃ (p.64b, l.1) vidhāya – madhusarpisvarṇadūrvāṅkurābhyāṃ vṛṣabhagāyatryā caret । vṛṣabhagāyatrī -
ti(dī)kṣṇaśri(śṛ)ṅgāya vidmahe vedapādāya dhīmahi tanno vṛṣabha(l.2)pracodayāt –
mūlamantraṃ ru?(vṛṣa)ṣaḍaṅgam । ityāddi(di) । godarśanādi sarvaṃ vidhāya – aṣṭamṛdbhiḥ pañcagavyena snānaṃ vinā saṃprokṣya śivā-mbhasā (l.3) saṃprokṣya – darpaṇabimbe pañcagavyādibhi(bhiḥ) snāpya jalādhivāsayet paścāt yāgaśālāyāṃ dhvajapaṭaṃ samānīyā(ya) vṛṣabhagāyatri(l.4)mantreṇa pañcagavyādinā snāpya – padamadhye – āsanaṃ saṃsthāpya vṛṣabhamūle om ādhāra-śaktaye namaḥ । anantāsanāya namaḥ । dharmāya namaḥ । jñānāya namaḥ । (l.5) vairāgyāya namaḥ । aiśvaryāya namaḥ । oṃ vṛṣabhāsanāya namaḥ । vṛṣabhamūrtaye namaḥ । vṛṣabhāya namaḥ । evaṃ praṇavādinamontaṃ vṛṣabhamūrti(rtiṃ) kalpayet – paścāt (l.6) grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā – vṛṣabhapaṭaṃ yāgagṛhasya paścimadvāramānīyya(ya) sāṣṭāṅgaṃ vṛṣabhamūrte'rghyaṃ datvā saṃpūjya vṛṣabhāṅgamantreṇa saṃsthāpyā(pya) । (p.65a, l.1) sthaṇḍi......deśāstīryā(rya) – paṭaṃ vinyasya । mṛduvastrayugaṃ vṛṣabhagāyatrīmantreṇa vinyasya ādhāraśaktyādi(dya)nantāsane dharmādicatuṣṭaṃ ca kṛtāsane – pūrvamastakaṃ vinyasya (l.2) śikhāyopadhānaṃ kṛtvā – vāsasāścādya । vṛṣabhamūrtau brahmāṇi mūrdhādi vinyasya । dhūpadīpanaivedyani(nī)rāñjanādisarvaṃ vidhāya – gra(gṛ)hopakaraṇāni (l.3) madhusarpimūlamantreṇa saṃsthāpya – astraśatālabdaṃ nidrākumbhaṃ saṃsthāpya । ukṣādi(dī)n pūjayet – vṛṣabhamūle sthitvā – mūrdhnādipāda(l.4)paryantaṃ catustriṃśat tatvāni sādhipāni vinyaset – tadyathā oṃ sadāśivatatvāya namaḥ । sadāśiva-tatvādhipataye brahmaṇa(ṇe) namaḥ । om īśvaratatvāya (l.5) namaḥ । īśvaratatvādhipataye anantāya namaḥ । śuddhavidyātatvāya namaḥ । śuddhavidyātatvādhipataye śambarāya namaḥ ।
viṣṇubhāge – māyātatvāya (l.6) namaḥ । māyātatvādhipataye gahaneśāya namaḥ । kālatatvāya namaḥ । kālatatvādhipataye kālana(nā)mne niti(yati)tatvāya namaḥ । niyatitatvādhipataye niyāmakāya (p.65b, l.1) namaḥ । vidyātatvāya namaḥ । vidyātatvādhipataye vedavijñānāya namaḥ । rāgatatvāya namaḥ । rāgatatvādhipataye kāmadāya namaḥ । puruṣatatvāya namaḥ । puruṣatatvādhi(l.2)pataye sūkṣmadehāya namaḥ । prakṛtitatvāya namaḥ prakṛtitatvādhipataye pradhānakāya namaḥ । guṇatatvāya namaḥ । guṇatatvādhipataye tridehāya namaḥ । (l.3) buddhitatvāya namaḥ । buddhitatvādhipataye buddhāya namaḥ । ahaṅkāratatvāya namaḥ । ahaṅkāratatvādhipataye'haṅkṛtine namaḥ । manastatvāya namaḥ । manastatvā(l.4)dhipataye saṅkalpāya namaḥ । śrotratatvāya namaḥ । śrotratatvādhipataye vyāmacā(ca)rāya namaḥ । tvaktatvāya namaḥ । tvaktatvādhipataye sarvāṅgāya (l.5) namaḥ । cakṣustatvāya namaḥ । cakṣustatvādhipataye prakāśakāya namaḥ । jihvātatvāya namaḥ । jihvātatvādhipataye mahāvaktrāya namaḥ । nāsātatvāya namaḥ । (l.6) nāsātatvādhipataye vilumbakāya namaḥ । vāktatvāya namaḥ । vāktatvādhipataye dundubhaye namaḥ । pāṇitatvāya namaḥ । pāṇitatvādhipataye (p.66a, l.1) ........ namaḥ । pādatatvāya namaḥ । pādatatvādhipataye ramaṇāya namaḥ । pāyutatvāya namaḥ । pāyutatvādhipāya kūrṇakṛte namaḥ । upasthatatvāya namaḥ । upastha(l.2)tatvādhipāya ghanānandāya namaḥ । śabdatatvāya namaḥ । śabdatatvādhipāya sūkṣmanādāya namaḥ । sparśatatvāya namaḥ । sparśatatvādhipā...balavattarāya (l.3) namaḥ । rūpatatvāya namaḥ । rūpatatvādhipāya bhānumate namaḥ । rasatatvāya namaḥ । rasatatvādhipāya jaladāya namaḥ । gandhatatvāya namaḥ । gandhatatvā-(l.4)dhipāya gandhāṅgāya namaḥ । vyomatatvāya namaḥ । vyomatatvādhipataye sūkṣmanādāya namaḥ । vāyutatvāya namaḥ । vāyu-tatvādhipāya (l.5) mātariśvane namaḥ । tejastatvāya namaḥ । tejastatvādhipāya tviṣāṃ nidhaye namaḥ । jalatatvāya namaḥ । jalatatvādhipāya jaleśāya namaḥ । pṛthivītatvāya namaḥ । (l.6) pṛthivītatvādhipāya śrīkaṇṭhāya namaḥ । iti brahmabhāge । evaṃ vinyasya – trikhaṇḍaṃ