ikā catuṣṭhanābho । kriyāśaktiṃ vinyasya ghaṭasthaṇḍilāni vṛṣai svāhā – svā(sā)yaṃ ca sahanāḍiṃ sandhānaṃ (l.3) kuryāt – tatsannidhānārthaṃ vṛṣabhamūlenāhutitrayaṃ datvā sthaṇḍile oṃ hām ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ । iti saṃpūjya । āhutitrayaṃ (l.4) datvā – oṃ ...... ātmatatvāya namaḥ । oṃ hām ātmatatvādhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ । oṃ hiṃ vidyātatvāya namaḥ । oṃ hiṃ vidyātatvādhipataye viṣmave (l.5) namaḥ । oṃ hūṃ śivatatvāya namaḥ । oṃ hūṃ śivatatvādhipataye rudrāya namaḥ । iti saṃpūjya । ātmatatvavidyātatva-brahmaviṣṇurudrāṇāṃ (l.6) cāhutitrayaṃ datvā – oṃ kṣmāmūrtaye namaḥ । kṣmāmūrtyadhipataye ukṣāya namaḥ । vahnimūrtaye namaḥ । vahnimūrtyadhipataye gopataye (p.68a, l.1) yajamānamūrtaye namaḥ । yajamānamūrtyadhipataye śri(śṛ)ṅgiṇe namaḥ । arkamūrtaye namaḥ । arkamūrtyadhipataye nandine namaḥ । jalamūrtaye namaḥ । jalamūrtyadhi(l.2)pataye vṛṣabhapataye namaḥ । vāyumūrtaye namaḥ । vāyumūrtyadhipataye vṛṣāṇine namaḥ । indumūrtaye namaḥ । indumūrtyadhipataye śaṅkukarṇāya (l.3) namaḥ । khamūrtaye namaḥ । khamūrtyadhipataye mahodarāya namaḥ । iti namontaṃ saṃpūjya । svāhāntam āhutitrayaṃ datvā vṛṣabhamūlamantraṃ (l.4) brahmāṅgāni ca pratyekaṃ śataṃ vā artha(rdha)pa(śa)taṃ hutvā । pūrṇāṃ hutvā ācāryaḥ śāntikumbhahastaṃ vṛṣabhasamīpaṃ gatvā guruḥ śānti(l.5)kumbhajalena prokṣya guruhṛdaya namaḥ । ityeteṣāṃ sannidhānaṃ kṛtvā varmaṇāvakuṇṭhya nirudhya tatvādhipā.....śrāvayet – (l.6) ātmatatvādhipan brahman yā yāvaddoṣasamutthitaḥ paṭe tāvat yā(tvayā)traiva sthātavyaṃ sannidhānataḥ । oṃ hāṃ hiṃ(hīṃ) ātmatatvavidyātatvābhyāṃ (p.68b, l.1) namaḥ । māyāntānādāntoccāreṇa saṃpūjayet – oṃ lūṃ kṣmāmūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । kṣmāmūrtibhyām ukṣābhyāṃ namaḥ । rapa(rūpa)vahnimūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । vahnimūrtyadhipābhyā(bhyāṃ) (l.2) gopataye namaḥ । oṃ śrā(śrūṃ) śrā (śrūṃ) yajamānamūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । yajamānamūrtibhyāṃ śriṅgiṇe namaḥ । ṣṭraṃ ṣṭram arkamūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । arkamūrtibhyāṃ nandibhyāṃ (l.3) namaḥ । oṃ vraṃ jalamūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । jalamūrtibhyāṃ vṛṣabhābhyāṃ – oṃ pūṃ yūṃ vāyumūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । vāyumūrtibhyāṃ vṛṣāṇibhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ sūṃ sūm indu(l.4)mūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । indumūrtibhyāṃ śaṅkukaṇṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ oṃ hūṃ hūṃ khamūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । mahodarābhyāṃ namaḥ । iti mūrti-mūrtyadhipāśca sandhānaṃ kuryuḥ (l.5) tataḥ sthā(stha)ṇḍilāntaṃ gatvā evaṃ saṃpūjyā(jya) – sandhānaṃ kṛtvā juhuyāt – viṣṇubhāge – śuddhārtham oṃ hiṃ vidyātatvāya namaḥ । vidyātatvādhi(l.6)pataye viṣṇave namaḥ । iti saṃpūjyā – sannidhāpya – oṃ kṣmāmūrtaye namaḥ । ukṣāya namaḥ । rūṃ vahnimūrtaye namaḥ । adhipataye gopataye namaḥ । (p.69a, l.1) oṃ śūṃ yajamānamūrtaye namaḥ । oṃ śūṃ yajamānamūrtaye namaḥ । yajamānamūrtyadhipataye śri(śṛ)ṅgiṇe namaḥ । oṃ ṣṭām arkamūrtaye namaḥ । arkamūrtyadhipataye nandine namaḥ । oṃ ṣṭrāṃ (l.2) jalamūlamūrtaye namaḥ । jalamūrtyadhipataye vṛṣabhapataye namaḥ । oṃ yūṃ vāyumūrtaye namaḥ । vāyumūrtyadhipataye vṛṣāṇine namaḥ । (l.3) hrām indumūrtaye namaḥ । indumūrtyadhipataye śaṅkukaṇṭhāya namaḥ । oṃ hūṃ khamūrtaye namaḥ । khamūrtyadhipataye mahodarāya namaḥ । (l.4) namontaṃ saṃpūjya – svāhāntam āhutitrayaṃ datvā – vṛṣabhamūlamantraṃ brahmāṅgāni ca śatamardhaṃ vā pratyekaṃ hutvā - (l.5) pūrṇāṃ datvā paścāt vṛṣabhapaṭasami(mī)paṃ gatvā – pūrvavat – śāntikumbhajalena prokṣya – kuśamadhye vṛṣabhamūlamantreṇa (l.6) viṣṇubhāge – saṃspṛśya homasaṅkhyā(khya)yā japtvā – punaḥ śāntyambhasā prokṣya – hṛdayasannidhiṃm avakuṇṭhya rghyaṃ(arghyaṃ) ca nirodhanaṃ ca (p.69b, l.1) vidhāyā(ya) viṣṇumājñāṃ śrāvayet – vidyātatvādhipataye viṣṇo sa yāvaddoṣasamutthitam । vṛṣe tāvat tvayātraiva sthātavyaṃ (l.2) sannidhānataḥ । tataḥ oṃ hūṃ hūṃ vidyātatvaśivatatvābhyāṃ namaḥ । vidyātatvaśivatatvādhipataye viṣṇuśivābhāyāṃ namaḥ । iti saṃpūjyā(jya) sadāśivāntaṃ (l.3) namontoccāraṇaṃ saṃpūjayet । oṃ lūṃ lūṃ kṣmāmūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । rūṃ rūṃ vahnimūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ śrūṃ śrūṃ yajamānamūrtibhyāṃ (l.4) namaḥ । oṃ ṣūṃ ṣūm arkamūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ pūṃ pūṃ jalamūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । yūṃ yūṃ vāyūmūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । sūṃ sūm indumūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ hūṃ hūṃ (l.5) khamūrtibhyāṃ namaḥ । iḍāmūrtyādibhiḥ śuddhāśuddhā dadyāt । oṃ hāṃ hāṃ kṣmāmūrtyādhipāya ukṣābhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ hiṃ vahnimūrtyadhipāya (l.6) gopataye namaḥ । yajamānamūrtyā(rtya)dhipāya śri(śṛ)ṅgibhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ hām arkamūrtyadhipāya nandibhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ jalamūrtyadhipāya vṛṣabhapatibhyāṃ (p.70a, l.1) namaḥ । oṃ pūṃ vāyumūrtyadhipāya vṛṣaṇebhyo namaḥ । om indumūrtyadhipataye śaṅkukarṇāya namaḥ । oṃ khamūrtyadhipāya mahodarāya namaḥ । (l.2) iti mūrtyādhipāśca sandhānaṃ kuryāt । tataḥ kuṇḍāntikaṃ gatvā – oṃ huṃ śivatatvāya namaḥ । oṃ hūṃ śivatatvādhipataye rudrāya namaḥ । iti (l.3) saṃpūjyā(jya) – sannidhāpya – kṣmāmūrtyadhipāya ukṣābhyāṃ namaḥ । oṃ vahnimūrtaye namaḥ । vahnimūrtyadhipataye gopataye namaḥ । (l.4) yajamānamūrtaye namaḥ । yajamānamūrtyadhipataye śri(śṛ)ṅgiṇe namaḥ । arkamūrtaye namaḥ । arkamūrtyadhipataye nandine namaḥ । (l.5) jalamūrtaye namaḥ । jalamūrtyadhipataye vṛṣabhapataye namaḥ । vāyumūrtaye namaḥ । vāyumūrtyadhipataye vṛṣāṇine namaḥ । (l.6) indumūrtaye namaḥ । indumūrtyadhipataye śaṅku-karṇāya namaḥ । khamūrtaye namaḥ । khamūrtyadhipataye mahoda-rāraya(rāya) namaḥ । iti (p.70b, f65a, l.1) namontaṃ saṃpūjya – svāhānta(ntam) āhutitrayaṃ datvā vṛṣabhamūlamantrabrahmāṅgāni ca pratyekaṃ śatamardhaṃ vā hutvā – paścāt (l.2) vṛṣabhapaṭasamīpaṃ gatvā – śāntijalenā(na) prokṣya vṛṣabhamūlena kuśāgreṇa rudrabhāge saṃspṛśya homasaṅkhyayā japtvā punaḥ (l.3) śaktyambhasā prokṣya – hṛdayāya namaḥ iti sannidhiṃ kṛtvā – avakuṇṭhaṃ nirudhya । rudrājñāṃ śrāvayet । bho bho rudra (l.4) tvayā jñātaśivatatvapade tvayā yāvaddoṣotthitapaṭe steyā ta(tā)vadiha prabho iti vijñāpya । tataḥ mūlādi(l.5)doṣa-niraha(nirha)raṇārthaṃ śivena aghoreṇa asinā śataṃ pūrṇāhutaṃ juhuyāt – paścāt caruṃ datvā pūrṇāṃ vidhāyā(ya) (l.6) ācamanatāmbūlaṃ datvā – vṛṣabhaṃ nidhya(nirudhya) – vyāhṛti hutvā antarbali(liṃ) datvā śrotravandanaṃ kṛtvā – sakalīkṛtya vṛṣa.... (p.71a, l.1) (bhasya) samīpaṃ gatvā – vṛṣabha...dakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā śravaṇe । bhagavan jñānato mohāt adhi...vṛṣabheśvara tatsarvamastu saṃpūrṇa(rṇaṃ) tvatprasādādiha(hā)dhvare । (l.2) oṃ namo bhagavate vṛṣabhāya dharmarūpāya namo'stu te karma pūrṇamapūrṇaṃ vā svaśaktyā parigṛhyatām iti vijñāpajñānaśaktiṃ vinyasyā(sya) (l.3) nirudhyā(dhya) – homairvā vaidaghoṣairvā nṛttagītamahotsavaibhaktyataḥ ekarātriṃ ca kuryāt – vṛṣādhivāsanam । (l.4) hotavyaṃ pratyahaṃ sva sva mūlamantraṃ śataṃ śataṃ vṛṣabhakumbhādi(dī)n pūjaṃ ca baliṃ ca nivedayet – guruśiṣyādisahi(l.5)......pañcagavyādikaṃ svapat – iti vṛṣabha-pratiṣṭhādhivāsanavidhi(dhiḥ) samāptaḥ ॥
