tri(tṛ)tīyaṃ brahmarātri syādgandharvaṃ tu caturthakam ॥
pañcamaṃ *bhūtarātriṃ syāt ṣaṣṭhamaṃ guharātrakam । * (l.6)
saptamaṃ ṛṣirātraṃ syāt aṣṭamaṃ nāgarātrakam ॥
navamam indrarātraṃ syāt daśamaṃ viṣṇurātrakam । (p.77b, f72a, l.1)
ekādaśaṃ tu rudraṃ syāt dvādaśaṃ śivarātrakam ॥
