mudgānnaṃ laḍḍukaṃ sarpi kadalīgulasaṃyuktam ॥
prathamehi(ha)ni dātavyaṃ vighna....manusmaran ।
śuddhānnaṃ kṛsarānnaṃ ca māṣayuktadadhiplutam ॥
dvitīyye*'hani dātavyaṃ paiśācamantramuccaran । * (l.2)
pāyasaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ apūpaṃ padmasaṃyuktam ॥
