kṛsarānnaṃ ... ntuṃ ca saghṛtaṃ mudgairyutam ॥
caturthe'hani dātavyā gandharvamantrama(mu)ccaran ।
indravalliharidrāntaṃ lājaṃ tu kṣi(kṣī)ra*saṃyutam ॥ * (l.4)
