ghṛtānnaṃ gulasaṃyuktaṃ nālikeraphalānvitam ॥
ṣaṣṭhe'hani ca dātavyaṃ *skandamantramanusmaran । * (l.5)
kuśāgrā dadhisaṃyuktā bṛhatīphalameva ca ॥
