balirevaṃ prakīrtitaṃ dravyāṇāmapyalābhe tu dadhikānnaṃ baliṃ kṣipet - (p.79a, l.1) brahmādyeśānaparyantaṃ baliṃ kṛtvā vicakṣaṇā(ṇa) – tattatsthānādisarveṣu vighnarājādintra(mantra)kai(kaiḥ) । arcayitvā vidhānena । dravyaiścaiva (l.2) baliṃ kṣipet । praṇavādi caturthantaṃ svanāmapadamadhyame । svāhāntaṃ balinirdeśaṃ sarpebo? iti yojayet । (l.3) sarvadevālayāgre tu baliṃ dadya(dadyā)t viśo(śe)ṣataḥ । evaṃ balikramaṃ kṛtvā balipīṭhe bali(liṃ) kṣipet । yāgaśālāṃ praviśya - (l.4) atha vajrādīn sthāpayet kramāt – liṅgamūrtiṃ visṛjyātha liṅgaṃ caiva vinikṣipet । grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ kuryāt – bā(ba)lyante (l.5) kautukaṃ yathāvidhi sammārjanaṃ kṛtvā – prokṣaye(yet) śuddhavāribhiḥ kadali(lī) kramukaṃ caiva saphalai(laiḥ) pūrṇakumbhakai(kaiḥ) । muktādāmaiśca (l.6) puṣpaiśca bhāvanaṃ prati bhūṣayet । dhvajaiśca vividhaiścaiva cāmarai(raiḥ) vyajanairyutaṃ rathe vā raṅgake vāpi (p.79b, f74a, l.1) śibikāropya bimbakān navavastreṇa saṃyuktaṃ nṛttageyasamākulaṃ puṣpaprabhāsamāyuktaṃ sarvālaṅkārasaṃyuktaṃ (l.2) pratimāṣṭadaśānāṃ tu ekaṃ vāpi dvayaṃ tu vā saptāhe vā navāhe va(vā) rathārohaṇakāryaṃ tatpūrve śilpibhiḥ saha ratham (l.3) aṅgapratyaṅga(ṅgaṃ) samyakpari(rī)kṣi(rī)kṣya dṛḍī(ḍhī)kṛ? rathaṅgatāgabhi(bhī)rapari(rī)kṣya śilpakarma samāpte sati । rathā-rohaṇapūrvara(rā)trau (l.4) rathaṃ ..... tu bandhanam । kṛtvā rathaṃ pañcagavya-mṛt-gomaya-kāṣāyodakairarghyeṇa śuddhajalenāstreṇā-bhiṣicya – śuddhiṃ kṛtvā – (l.5) punaḥ pañcagavyenārghyena(ṇa) saṃprokṣyā(kṣya) – prāsādāgre rathāgre vā maṇṭapaṃ yathoktalakṣaṇaṃ vidhāya gomayeno(l.6)palipya vighneśvarapūjādipuṇyāhajalena maṇṭapaṃ ca rathaṃ ca saṃprokṣya – pañcagavyenārghyeṇa saṃprokṣya - (p.80a, dhvajārohaṇavidhiḥ, l.1) gandhādibhiralaṅkṛtya yathoktaprakāreṇa rathau kautukaṃ bandhaitvā । dhūpadīpau datvā – rathaṃ vicitrapaṭādibhiralaṅkṛtya diśvi(gvi)saihaḥ? (l.2) kadalīpūgastambhanālikeraphalādibhiralaṅkṛtya – yāgaśālāyā(yāṃ) vedakopari lakṣaṇai(ṇaiḥ) sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā sūtravastrakūrcā(l.3)dibhi(rabhi)dhāne hemaratnasahitaṃ madhyakumbhādi(dī)ni saṃsthāpya – pūrvādyaṣṭadikṣu aṣṭau kalaśān saṃsnāpya – tataḥ dvāra(l.4)pūjādibhūtaśuddhiṃ ta(anta)ryāgapañcagavyaṃ kṛtvā madhyakumbhe śivaṃ śaktyādiśaktiparyantaṃ saṃpūjya । daṇḍabhaṅgimuṇḍabhaṅgiaṣṭa(l.5)triṃśatkalānyāsaṃ vidhāya dhyānamāvāhanādisarvopacārān kṛtvā tataḥ pūrvādikumbheṣu pūrve bhānumāgneyyāmindu(p.80b, f75a, l.1)dakṣiṇe hariṃ - naiṛte gaṇapatiṃ – paścime vṛṣabhaṃ – vāyavye anantaṃ – saumye dharmapatiṃ – aiśānye dharādharaṃ – evaṃ krameṇa (l.2) svanātmā(mnā) āsanamūrtimūlairāvāhanādi-sarvopacārān kṛtvā ityeṣāṃ pāyasānnaṃ nivedya – japāntaṃ saṃpūjya - (l.3) kuṇḍāntikaṃ gatvā – agnikāryoktamārgeṇa kuṇḍasaṃskārān tarpaṇadīpanāntaṃ pūrvavat kṛtvā śivāgniṃ saṃkalpya - (l.4) samidānnājyai(jye)na dravyaṃ prati mūlenāṣṭottara-śataṃ hutvā – navadhānyai(nyaiḥ) brahmabhiraṅgaiśca hutvā – dravyānte vyāhṛtiṃ hutvā pūrṇāṃ datvā (l.5) antarbaliṃ bahirbaliṃ kṛtvā prātaḥ guruḥ snā(snānā)dicatuṣṭayaṃ kṛtvā pūrvavat pūrvavat kalaśādhana? homaṃ ca kṛtvā – rathāntikaṃ gatvā karanyāsaṃ (l.6) .... pañcagavyena prokṣya nirīkṣaṇādisaṃskṛtya । rathaṃ darbhāgrai(graiḥ)spṛṣṭvā – pañcaśāntibhirvā vyomavyāpyā vā japtvā mantrān ....di(p.81a, l.1)....kṛtvā rathe sarvadevān prapūjayet – tadyatha(thā) vajradaṇḍadvaye vṛṣabhāya namaḥ । cakreṣu sūryāya namaḥ । candramase namaḥ । madhyadaṇḍe viṣṇubhāgeṣu (l.2) haraye namaḥ । vajriṇe namaḥ । ekapīṭhe dvidaṇḍakāya namaḥ । patākāsu śatarudrāya namaḥ । gātreṣu dharmādīn saṃpūjya – sthālikāyāṃ sadāśivāya (l.3) namaḥ । sandhiṣu dakṣiṇa(ṇā)mūrtaye namaḥ । viṣṇave namaḥ । brahmaṇe namaḥ । skandāya namaḥ । rathaprānte lokapālān saṃpūjya – rajjuṣu (l.4) uragebhyo namaḥ । chatre pāśudāstrāya namaḥ । dhvaje vṛṣabhāya namaḥ । mukhabhadre – brahmāṇaṃ sārathya – kalpitvā – śikharūrdhve (l.5) rī(ī)śānāya namaḥ । pūrvādicaturdikṣu tatpuruṣāghoravāmasadyaśca saṃpūjya – pārśvadvaye japaṃ saṃpūjya – tadakre caturvedam aśva(l.6)rūpaṃ dhyātvā – ṣaḍarthanyāsaṃ samāpayet – ādhāre bhuvādhvā cāpādavarge ca prastare – kalādhvā ca tatvādhvā galadeśake (p.81b, f76, l.1) varṇādhvā śikharamantrādhvā ca nyavenyase....pyā kramāt saṃpūjya deśikaḥ mūlādhārasthāyiṣṭhanamaṇipūrakaanāhatavi-śuddhirājñāpāyya (l.2) tattatsthaṃ nyastvā – rathadhyānam –
pañcavarṇamahādīptamabhayaṃ varadānvitam ।
ṣaṭpadaṃ caiva kukṣiṃ ca śūlaṃ pāśaṃ caturbhujam ॥ (l.3)
ekavaktraṃ triṇetraṃ ca ṣaṭsthalaṃ maṅgalānvitam ।
pādaṃ cakrasamāyuktaṃ bhūtādhāraṃ ca nāsikam ॥
prauḍa(ḍha)sthalaṃ sujānvākhya *uparisthalamūrakam । * (l.4)
kukṣi devāsanaṃ proktaṃ hṛdayaṃ stambhameva ca ॥
kūṭasthaṃ dadvapaṃ? proktaṃ kaṇṭhaṃ kaṇṭhamiti smṛtam ।
śiraśśira*śikhācūli sārādhyaṃ vidhikalpitam ॥ * (l.5)
rathadhyānamidaṃ proktaṃ sarvamaṅgalakāraṇam ।
	iti dhyātvā । evaṃ devīskandavināyaka(l.6)caṇḍeśvarāṇāṃ tattaddhṛde saṃpūjya – paścādvedikakumbhān naivedyādupacāraṃ kṛtvā – sarvamaṅgalopetamālayapradakṣiṇa.....(ṇaṃ kṛ) (p.82a, l.1)tvā rathāgre saṃsnāpya – rathaṃ dhūpadīpau datvā । sumuhūrte tattatsthāne'bhiṣecayet । dhūpadīpau datvā devaṃ namaskṛtvā rathārohaṇa(ṇaṃ) (l.2) kra(kri)yatāmiti vijñāpya – śivānujñayā sarvavādyasahitaṃ sumuhūrte sulagne rathe samāropya – pūrṇakumbhatilapātraṃ savatsāṃ (l.3) gāṃ pradarśya brāhmaṇebhyo dadyāt – ācāryādibhaktānāṃ janāntaṃ vastrahemaphalatāmbūlādīni dadyāt – sarveṣāṃ (l.4) santoṣya – paścāt devāgre sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā svarṇādighaṭā hemakuṅkumāgarurpūracandanāharidrādyairva(rvā) (l.5) sanniyojya pāṭalutpalajājipunnāgacampakādra(rdra)paṅkena nikṣipya – kuṅkumavastrādinā kaṭāhaṃ pariveṣya sthaṇḍile (l.6) vinyasya – sakalīkṛtyārghyajalenāstreṇa saṃprokṣya kavacenābhyukṣya – kaṭāhe kāmabījenābhyarcya – ādravamapi (p.82b, f77a, l.1) mūlenābhyarcya śaktyādiśaktyantam abhyarcya – nirīkṣaṇādibhirviśodhya । amṛtamudrāṃ darśayet – dhūpadīpau datvā – mūlaliṅgādiberāṇāṃ ca (l.2) dhṛtvā । ārdrapaṅkakuṅkumoṣṇīṣaṃ ca dhṛtvā deśikaḥ svayaṃ caritvigbhi(gbhiḥ) sahārdrapaṅkaṃ kuṅkumoṣṇīṣaṃ ca dhṛtvā bhuvayajamānaḥ (l.3) bhaktādisarvajanānāṃ dāpayet । vighneśvaraberāṇāṃ tattaddhṛdhe(de) samāropya – śubhāṅkhaśacaralagne svastipūrvaṃ samastavādya(l.4)-sahitaṃ grāmapradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā ācāryādibhaktāntaṃ rathe samāropya – grāma(maṃ) pradakṣiṇīkṛtya । devaṃ rathādevā(vāva)tāryālayaṃ praviśya (l.5) prāyaścitādikaṃ kṛtvā – ācāryavastrādibhaḥ santoṣya mahāhavirnivedya – sarveṣāṃ dāpayediti rathārohaṇa-vidhiḥ ॥ (l.6)
(kṛṣṇagandhavidhiḥ -)
aṣṭame ca navāhe ca kṛṣṇagandhavidhi śruṇu । 
iṣṭakāmyārthasiddhyarthaṃ putrapautrādihetukam ॥
brahmahatyādidoṣaghnaṃ sarvaśatra(tru)*nivāraṇam । * (p.83a, l.1)
rājā vijayasaubhāgyaṃ subhikṣaṃ sasyavardhanam ॥
yo vā kopānṛttamūrtiṃ darśanāt phalamaśnute ।
sthānāntare gate sṛṣṭisthiti*kautukabandhanam ॥ * (l.2)
saṃhāramagaruṃ caiva tirodhaṃ karpūralepanam ।
prabhāte nṛttasevāyām anugrahastathaiva ca ॥
ityuktvā nṛttamūrtiṃ (l.3) āsthānamaṇṭape samānīyā(ya) yathā saṃsthāpanādikaṃ kṛtvā – nṛttamūrtiṃ saṃpūjya – rakṣābandhanaṃ pūrvoktaprakāreṇa kṛtvā (l.4) aṣṭamadinātpararātrau balibhramaṇotsavānte ka(kau)tukaṃ? kṛtvā – naivedyādyupacāraṃ kṛtvā (l.5) ubha(bhā)vapyalaṅkṛtya sarvamaṅgalavādyairālayapradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā āsthānamaṇṭape saṃsnāpya nṛttagītastotrādi-vinoda(dada)rśanena (l.6) rātriśeṣaṃ vyapohayet – darbhaiḥ puṣpaiḥ paristi(sta)ret – e(ye')tra madhye kālakaṇṭhaṃ saṃsnāpya vighneśvarapūjā(p.83b, l.1)ra(pura)ssaraṃ puṇyāhaṃ kṛtvā । ekatri(tra) śāntikumbhaṃ pūrvoktavidhivat kṛtvā – agnikāryaṃ pūrṇāntaṃ kṛtvā tasmin maheśaṃ saṃpūjya (l.2)
śami(mī)bilvāvaṭāśuddhasarṣapaśca yavastilān । 
vaiṇavaṃ śālimāṣāṇi sahitāṃ ca hunet kramāt ॥
dravyānte vyāhṛtiṃ hutvā *pūrṇāhutiṃ punaḥ punaḥ । * (l.3)
aṣṭottaraśatasaṅkhyayā hunet – ājyena mūlenāṣṭottaraśataṃ kṛtvā । bilvaphalakadalīpanasādi(l.4)tatvatrayeṇa hutvā pūrṇāṃ datvā taṇḍulaparitasthālikāyaṃ(yāṃ) kṛṣṇagandhaṃ svarṇādipātre tripādyupari sthaṇḍile saṃsthāpya (l.5) vastreṇāveṣṭya karpūrādyai(dyaiḥ) sugandhairmiśrīkṛtya sakalīkaraṇādi kṛtvā aghoreṇa saṃprokṣya – varmaṇāvakuṇṭhya (l.6) brahmāṅgairmūlenābhimantrya dhenumudrāṃ pradarśya pādyādidhūpadīpau datvā sampātābhihutān pūrṇāṃ vidhāyā(ya) kṛṣṇagandhaṃ (p.84a, l.1) śaktyādiśaktyantam abhyarcya – naivedya – mūlenāṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā agni(gniṃ) visṛjya – maṅgalaghoṣairālayapradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā - (l.2) garbhagehe liṅgāgre saṃsthāpya – devā daṇḍabhāgyādiaṣṭatriṃśatkalānyāsaṃ vidhāyā(ya) – śaktyādi-śaktyantamabhyarcya – devasya pañca(l.3)brahmamantrai(ntraiḥ) kṛṣṇagandhaṃ pañcavaktreṣu dhṛtvā – naivedyādiṣoḍaśopacāraṃ kṛtvā । anantaraṃ kṛṣṇagandhaṃ (l.4) naṭeśāgre saṃsthāpya – naṭeśaṃ śaktyādiśaktyantam abhyarcya āsanamūrtidaṇḍabhaṅgimuṇḍabhaṅgi-ekatriṃśatkalānyāsaṃ (l.5) śrīkhaṇḍa(kaṇṭha)nyāsaṃ ca vinyasya – dhyānam । saṅkīrṇajaṭamundubhaimakurari । muṇḍāsthidevāpagāścetātla(tātma)kadramarāja(l.6)chinnakadharaṃ devyāṅghrikṛtyambaraṃ sarpasavyakarebhayaṃ ḍamarikaṃ vāmaṃ prasādhānyakaṃ vāmāgniṃ dadhataśayānaharita(p.84b, f79a, l.1)bhābha(ga)smārapra(pṛ)ṣṭhe sthitaṃ vajrīkṛtya sva dakṣiṇaṃ ca caraṇaṃ coddhṛtya vāmaṃ padāṃ madhyasthā dhvajakiṅkiṇimaṇikūlā koṭi sprarat (l.2) ...dukaṃ dakṣeṇa tu tu kuṇḍalaṃ śrutipaṭe vāme'nupatrānvitaṃ bhasmāliptamumāyutaṃ triṇaya namaḥ vande naṭeśaṃ śivam । (l.3) ityāvāhya – devīdhyānam – śyāmāṃ paramiścariṃ ca ityubhāvapi saṃpūjya – dhūpadīpau datvā – paiṣṭyena pāyasena (l.4) phalāpūpādinā saha – naivedyatāmbūlādi-ṣoḍaśopacārān kṛtvā – kṛṣṇagandhalepanaṃ kuryā(ryāt) lalāṭe aghoreṇa (l.5) sarvatra sadyena dāpayet – paścāt umāmaheśvarasyānantaraṃ sarvaberāṇāṃ dāpayet – strīberāṇāṃ ca lalāṭe (l.6) gale tanmūlenā(na) hṛdā vā dhārayet – paścāddeśikādibhaktajanānāṃ kṛṣṇagandhaṃ dāpayet । devaṃ ratnasiṃhāsane – (p.85a, l.1) tadvāme gaurīm । savyadeśikena sahāropya – vāmato'grato nā nṛpā nṛttaki(kī) nṛttakāśca ubhayapārśvayoḥ gehaṃ prati nṛttakaṃ kāryam । (l.2) vādyaiḥ saha saptagṛhāntaṃ gatvā ālayaṃ praviśya naivedyādi pūrvavat kuryāt – paścādāsthānamaṇṭape saṃsthāpya – aṣṭapuṣpikayā (l.3) arghyaṃ datvā nīrāñjanādyai pūjayet । paścāt gavyastapadādinā saṃsnāpya śuddhakarpūraṃ pūrvavat saṃskṛtyālipya (l.4) śukla-vastreṇa śubhramālyaiśvetanaṃ ca dhṛtvālaṅkṛtya – pāyasādi nivedya dhūpadīpau datvā – yānakāle (l.5) patnīṃ yānāśanaiśanai kāryaṃ tatra vedanṛttagītādibhiḥ pūrvavat patni yānā kṛtvā nīrājja(ñja)nādi sarvaṃ vat(pūrvavat) kṛtvālayaṃ praviśya (l.6) sarvopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya – rātriśeṣaṃ vinirdiśenāvyapohayet – aruṇodaye narteśaṃ saṃpūjyālayaṃ kṛtyā nadyādau (p.85b, f80a, l.1) .....t tīrthaṃ kṛtvā – kautukaṃ visṛjya sarvā(rva)vādyopetaṃ purādikaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya śuddhadeśe duṣṭanigrahaśiṣṭaparipālanaṃ sa.... (l.2)vahāre vācakaṃ ca śrāvayitvā devyā praṇayakalahaṃ vyapohya pariveṣṭaṃ vinālayaṃ praviśya – svasthāne saṃsthāpya ..... (l.3)panādyairabhiṣicya – nivedyādiśuddhanṛttaṃ kārayediti kṛṣṇagandhavidhiḥ ॥
